Input: a = 60, b = 36
Output: 12


Explanation: GCD of 60 and 36 is 12
class Solution {
    public static int gcd(int a, int b) {
        while(b!=0){
            int temp=b;
            b=a%b;
            a=temp;
        }
         return a;
    }
   
}


